# 统一行尾：仓库内一律存 LF，检出也一律用 LF
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理对 LF 敏感，这两个扩展名保持 CRLF
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制：不做行尾转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.pdf binary
